+#
+# metadata.yml for OpenXcom3D
+
+name: "OpenXcom3D - First-Person View"
+version: 0.7
+description: "Adds a first-person 3D view of the battlescape (F8): mouse look, real-time movement paid with time units (WASD), firing from the crosshair, a squad bar with soldier camera cards, lights, shadows, flashlight, particles, weather, tactical flares, combat music and its own 3D View options tab. Needs the OpenXcom3D build of OXCE; on a standard OXCE build this mod reports an unsupported engine and stays off."
+author: OpenXcom3D project
+
+master: "*"
+requiredExtendedEngine: OpenXcom3D
+requiredExtendedVersion: "0.7"
